    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/florist-elementor/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Florist Elementor is a multipurpose, modern, and elegant WordPress theme designed especially for florists, flower shops, bouquet designers, and creative agencies. Built with Elementor, this user-friendly theme allows anyone, from a professional developer to a beginner, to create a beautiful, minimal, and sophisticated website with ease. Its drag-and-drop interface and rich personalization options make customization simple and flexible. The theme features a visually appealing Banner section to showcase seasonal collections, offers, or events, along with an engaging Call to Action Button (CTA) that helps convert visitors into customers. A dedicated testimonial section builds trust, while the Team section allows you to introduce your designers and staff professionally. With seamless social media integration, you can connect your website to your online presence effortlessly. Florist Elementor is fully responsive and mobile-friendly, ensuring your website looks stunning on all devices. It is retina-ready, offering sharp visuals and a Luxurious feel that enhances the overall browsing experience. The theme uses optimized code, clean code, and secure and clean code, resulting in a faster page load time and reliable performance. Powered by Bootstrap, Florist Elementor includes engaging animated elements, shortcodes, and interactive features that elevate your website’s appeal. It is also translation-ready, making it suitable for global audiences. Whether you’re building a personal florist website or an agency-friendly project, this theme delivers Customization Options, a clean, interactive, and responsive design, and a truly beautiful online storefront that reflects creativity and professionalism."
    },
